sections of the quasi-coherent pseudofunctor `Scheme.qcohPseudofunctorOver S`.

## Main definitions

* `Quasicoherent/Basic.lean`: `AlgebraicGeometry.QCoh`, its structure sheaf, global sections and
  global functions, pullback, and the comparison with a scheme for a representable stack.
